able (bank transfer or cheque). When it settles an earlier payment demand it cites it: 'tax invoice/receipt for transaction account N'."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_01_08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_leanltd_2974nis_moonlight_coldplay_tribute_show", "label": "Moonlight - Coldplay tribute show (SKU \u05e7\u05d5\u05dc\u05d3\u05e4\u05dc\u05d9\u05d9, \u05dc\u05d4\u05e7\u05ea \u05de\u05d5\u05e0\u05dc\u05d9\u05d9\u05d8)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-01-08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_LeanLTD_2974nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The band product sold as a single line item '\u05de\u05d5\u05e4\u05e2 \u05de\u05d7\u05d5\u05d5\u05d4 \u05e7\u05d5\u05dc\u05d3\u05e4\u05dc\u05d9\u05d9' under SKU '\u05e7\u05d5\u05dc\u05d3\u05e4\u05dc\u05d9\u05d9'; it is the main revenue line in January 2026 (six of the ten issued documents)."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_01_08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_leanltd_2974nis_lean_ltd_ticket_office", "label": "Lean Ticket Office Ltd (\u05dc\u05d0\u05df \u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3 \u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd \u05d1\u05e2\u05de / LeanLTD)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-01-08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_LeanLTD_2974nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ticketing company that remits ticket-sale proceeds for the Music City 25/12 Moonlight show; invoiced per sales channel (Friends & Poalim/Wonder vs. general tickets)."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_01_08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_leanltd_2974nis_moonlight_music_city_25_12_show", "label": "Moonlight Coldplay tribute at Music City, 25/12/2025", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-01-08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_LeanLTD_2974nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One show billed to two different counterparties: ticket revenue via LeanLTD (60212, 60213) and a separate charge to NMC Shaked Clubs (40218)."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_01_08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_leanltd_2974nis_split_bank_transfer_16722", "label": "Single 16,722 NIS bank transfer split across invoices 60212 + 60213", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-01-08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_LeanLTD_2974nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "LeanLTD paid one bank transfer (2,974 + 13,748 = 16,722 NIS) to Bank Discount; it was split into two tax invoice/receipts so each ticket-sales channel (Friends & Poalim/Wonder vs. general tickets) gets its own document. A bank reconciler must match one deposit to two invoices."}, {"id": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_01_08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_leanltd_2974nis_vat_inclusive_gross_pricing", "label": "VAT-inclusive gross pricing (net back-computed from a round gross)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-01-08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_LeanLTD_2974nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Moonlight line prices such as 2,520.339, 11,650.8475, 2,605.0847, 22,186.4407 and 2,103.3898 equal a round gross total divided by 1.18, i.e. the agreed fee is a VAT-inclusive round number and the net is derived. Tel Aviv-Yafo (60216) is the exception, priced at a round 14,000 net."}], "edges": [{"source": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_01_08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_leanltd_2974nis", "target": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_01_08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_leanltd_2974nis_itamar_miron_im_productions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "havila/2026-01-to-2026-04/invoices-issued/2026-01-08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_LeanLTD_2974nis.pdf", "source_location": "p1", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_01_08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_leanltd_2974nis", "target": "havila_2026_01_to_2026_04_invoices_issued_2026_01_08_type320_num60212_\u05dc\u05d0\u05df_\u05de\u05e9\u05e8\u05d3_\u05db\u05e8\u05d8\u05d9\u05e1\u05d9\u05dd_\u05d1\u05e2\u05de_leanltd_2974nis_morning_green_inv